      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Dr. Mundo resists the first Immobilizing effect that hits him, instead losing Health and dropping a chemical cannister nearby. Dr. Mundo can pick it up by walking over it, restoring Health and reducing this Ability's Cooldown. Dr. Mundo also has significantly increased Health regeneration.",
      "summary_zh": "蒙多医生抵抗他受到的第一个定身效果，但会失去生命值并在附近掉落一罐化学药剂。蒙多医生可移动到化学药剂上来拾取它，从而回复生命值并缩短这个技能的冷却时间。 蒙多医生也会显著提升生命回复。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1495309:4038331"
