      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Passive - Dr. Mundo gains bonus Attack Damage, increasing based on his max Health. Active - Dr. Mundo slams his “medical” bag into an enemy, dealing additional damage based on his missing Health. If the enemy dies they are swatted away, dealing damage to enemies they pass through.",
      "summary_zh": "被动 - 蒙多医生获得额外攻击力，数额会基于他的最大生命值而提升。 主动 - 蒙多医生用他的“医用”手提包猛砸一个敌人，造成基于他已损失生命值的额外伤害。如果这个敌人被击杀，那么还会被拍飞，对途经的所有敌人造成伤害。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
